{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>今日（21日）早上11時許，警方接獲報案，指將軍澳厚德邨德富樓懷疑有貓爬出單位，被困德富樓3樓單位外牆的冷氣機頂。消防員及愛護動物協會人員到場，在樓上單位伸出網圈，其後成功將貓帶返安全位置。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T09:23:54.804387+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":95,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T08:02:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T16:07:29.437148+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T09:17:28.027985+00:00","content_hash":"e4a761c3d83d8546b274a0f748061e1c55aa0ba3d61c13f5137756e1ddf32dd5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}